{"3246990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Encave", "steam_appid": 3246990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5044010], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/7ee1ce6e0a2a83a09060fc9ff105c399.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=147 /></span><strong>ENCAVE Corporation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep beneath the surface, ENCAVE Biotech Corporation breeds living weapons. Most never make it to market....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/27d0ce709ffa7bbfb4079c65c89c93ab.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/27d0ce709ffa7bbfb4079c65c89c93ab.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/27d0ce709ffa7bbfb4079c65c89c93ab.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is to dispose of the failures...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an ENCAVE employee, you'll construct and upgrade deadly killrooms to eliminate rejected bioweapon specimens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/165ae4567b7b27552fb781433bad281f.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/165ae4567b7b27552fb781433bad281f.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/165ae4567b7b27552fb781433bad281f.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every wave...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated creatures will smash through walls, destroy fortifications, and carve new paths toward your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your defenses and fight alongside the machines you've built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defensive layouts using turrets, traps, mines, barricades, and reinforced walls while preparing for increasingly dangerous containment breaches.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/d488110de20c6df33e658384df87ca71.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/030f875da60c60168b549f980a7e6ef2.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/030f875da60c60168b549f980a7e6ef2.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/030f875da60c60168b549f980a7e6ef2.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build and customize your own killrooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deploy turrets, traps, mines, walls, and barricades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully destructible environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fight alongside your defenses in first-person combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/5e5c923d84c39f3e332e23bce3cff7e8.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/5e5c923d84c39f3e332e23bce3cff7e8.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/5e5c923d84c39f3e332e23bce3cff7e8.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enemies can breach and destroy your fortifications</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Increasingly difficult waves of unique mutant specimens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Corporate sci-fi atmosphere with dark humor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The products failed inspection...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now they're your problem...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/f20420d992b86682a40b785e3fe19999.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=920 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/f20420d992b86682a40b785e3fe19999.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/f20420d992b86682a40b785e3fe19999.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>These features are actively being developed and may change during development.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Usage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI-generated  content is included in the final game or presented to players. Generative AI was used only during early development for consultation, brainstorming, and conceptual exploration. <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/7ee1ce6e0a2a83a09060fc9ff105c399.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=147 /></span><strong>ENCAVE Corporation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep beneath the surface, ENCAVE Biotech Corporation breeds living weapons. Most never make it to market....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/27d0ce709ffa7bbfb4079c65c89c93ab.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/27d0ce709ffa7bbfb4079c65c89c93ab.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/27d0ce709ffa7bbfb4079c65c89c93ab.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is to dispose of the failures...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an ENCAVE employee, you'll construct and upgrade deadly killrooms to eliminate rejected bioweapon specimens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/165ae4567b7b27552fb781433bad281f.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/165ae4567b7b27552fb781433bad281f.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/165ae4567b7b27552fb781433bad281f.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every wave...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated creatures will smash through walls, destroy fortifications, and carve new paths toward your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your defenses and fight alongside the machines you've built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defensive layouts using turrets, traps, mines, barricades, and reinforced walls while preparing for increasingly dangerous containment breaches.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/d488110de20c6df33e658384df87ca71.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/030f875da60c60168b549f980a7e6ef2.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/030f875da60c60168b549f980a7e6ef2.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/030f875da60c60168b549f980a7e6ef2.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build and customize your own killrooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deploy turrets, traps, mines, walls, and barricades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully destructible environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fight alongside your defenses in first-person combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/5e5c923d84c39f3e332e23bce3cff7e8.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/5e5c923d84c39f3e332e23bce3cff7e8.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/5e5c923d84c39f3e332e23bce3cff7e8.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enemies can breach and destroy your fortifications</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Increasingly difficult waves of unique mutant specimens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Corporate sci-fi atmosphere with dark humor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The products failed inspection...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now they're your problem...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/f20420d992b86682a40b785e3fe19999.poster.avif?t=1788157826\" width=920 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/f20420d992b86682a40b785e3fe19999.webm?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/f20420d992b86682a40b785e3fe19999.mp4?t=1788157826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>These features are actively being developed and may change during development.</i></p>